Package: croc
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: securely send files and folders between computers
 croc transfers files and folders between any two machines through a
 relay, end-to-end encrypted via a password-authenticated key exchange:
 both ends only need the generated code phrase. Interrupted transfers
 resume. A public relay brokers connections by default; croc relay runs
 a self-hosted one (an example systemd unit ships with the package).
